d) {\n  1282\t                        let _ = module.mark_initialized();\n  1283\t                        if let Err(error) = module.mark_running() {\n  1284\t                            tracing::warn!(\n  1285\t                                module_id,\n  1286\t                                \"frontend mount lifecycle transition failed: {error}\"\n  1287\t                            );\n  1288\t                        }\n  1289\t                    }\n  1290\t                }\n  1291\t                Err(error) => {\n  1292\t                    if let Some(module) = self.modules.get_mut(&module_id) {\n  1293\t                        let _ = module.mark_failed(error.to_string());\n  1294\t                    }\n  1295\t                    return Err(ShellRunError::Component(error));\n  1296\t                }\n  1297\t            }\n  1298\t        }\n  1299\t        // Mount first so module scripts can establish their service proxy;\n  1300\t        // then deliver the revisioned effective settings snapshot normally.\n  1301\t        requests.extend(self.sync_settings_service_state()?);\n  1302\t        requests.extend(self.sync_composition_service_state()?);\n  1303\t        self.service_delivery_index.mark_dirty();\n  1304\t        Ok(requests)\n  1305\t    }\n  1306\t}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
