sactions with typed\n   325\t      invocation failures, deadlines/cancellation, explicit coalescing outcomes,\n   326\t      and rollback/settlement for optimistic `stateBinding` writes.\n   327\t- [ ] Gate provider/profile commits on validated readiness and buffered initial\n   328\t      state; immediately deliver unavailability and reject all state/events/results\n   329\t      from stopped or obsolete provider generations.\n   330\t- [ ] Diff the complete compiled contract in consumer and provider directions,\n   331\t      load external candidate contracts, align LSP/static analysis/codegen with\n   332\t      the runtime ABI, and remove the unused transitional `ServiceRegistry`.\n   333\t\n   334\t## Themes\n   335\t\n   336\t- [ ] Make graph-authorized theme descriptors the only catalog/loader, with\n   337\t      contained mode sources and one composed base/pack/module/user cascade;\n   338\t      remove the private `config/themes` manifest and legacy JSON paths. [Audit](../.planning/log/sections/04-themes/improvements.md).\n   339\t- [ ] Make theme selection, profile switching, graph changes, and hot reload one\n   340\t      durable prepare/commit transaction that preserves the last-known-good\n   341\t      snapshot, refreshes watches/catalog state, and never exits on bad CSS.\n   342\t- [ ] Share the restricted CSS/token/keyframe lowering path between themes and\n   343\t      components so pseudo-states, inherited custom properties, token recipes,\n   344\t      and general theme keyframes work or produce source-located diagnostics.\n   345\t- [ ] Complete `mesh.theme` and settings with modes, sparse token overrides,\n   346\t      provenance, explicit color-scheme/contrast, and revisioned authoritative\n   347\t      events instead of ID heuristics and provider-overwritable render facts.\n   348\t\n   349\t## Localization / i18n\n   350\t\n   351\t- [ ] Replace per-surface locale engines and the cross-module global key pool\n   352\t      with one graph-authorized immutable catalog snapshot, strict module/interface\n   353\t      scopes, provenance, and atomic last-known-good refresh. [Audit](../.planning/log/sections/05-localization-i18n/improvements.md).\n   354\t- [ ] Make locale selection a durable revisioned settings/profile transaction:\n   355\t      normalize BCP 47, derive the full fallback chain and direction, apply each\n   356\t      module's default terminally, and remove stale/per-component locale mutation.\n   357\t- [ ] Compile bounded typed catalogs with per-entry diagnostics, interpolation,\n   358\t      CLDR plural/select and formatting; add targeted language-pack identities,\n   359\t      ordered key-level precedence, and deterministic duplicate validation.\n   360\t- [ ] Route templates, Luau, manifests, props, generated settings, and debug data\n   361\t      through one owner-aware resolver with visible misses; align `mesh.i18n`,\n   362\t      `mesh.locale`, service events, and read/write capability enforcement.\n   363\t- [ ] Drive locale CLI/LSP/doctor, extraction, missing-key and provenance tooling\n   364\t      from the canonical graph/snapshot, and either implement `<i18n>` component\n   365\t      blocks with explicit precedence or reject them instead of discarding them.\n   366\t\n   367\t## Host resources and icon packs\n   368\t\n   369\t- [ ] Replace discovery-time global resource registration with one immutable,\n   370\t      graph/profile-authorized icon-and-font snapshot and atomic last-known-good\n   371\t      lifecycle reconciliation. [Audit](../.planning/log/sections/06-host-resources-and-icon-packs/improvements.md).\n   372\t- [ ] Make icon resolution deterministic and complete: canonical owner-scoped\n   373\t      pack IDs/aliases, typed multicolor mappings, semantic/dash fallbacks,\n   374\t      ordered chains, and required/optional results with provenance.\n   375\t- [ ] Complete font-pack runtime support with logical and pack-qualified roles,\n   376\t      orde