-18-\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-19-Translations are **scoped by module id**: `results.files` in\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-20-`@mesh/launcher` never collides with `results.files` in another module. This\n--\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-23-\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-24-## 2. Module-bundled catalogs\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-25-\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-26-```json\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-27-\"mesh\": {\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-28-  \"i18n\": { \"defaultLocale\": \"en\", \"supportedLocales\": [\"en\", \"sk\"] },\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-29-  \"provides\": {\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-30-    \"i18n\": [\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md:31:      { \"id\": \"en\", \"locale\": \"en\", \"path\": \"config/i18n/en.json\" },\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md:32:      { \"id\": \"sk\", \"locale\": \"sk\", \"path\": \"config/i18n/sk.json\" }\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-33-    ]\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-34-  }\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-35-}\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-36-```\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-37-\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-38-- `mesh.i18n.supportedLocales` is install metadata (which language assets an\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-39-  installer may fetch/enable); `defaultLocale` is the module's terminal\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-40-  fallback and belongs in `supportedLocales`.\n--\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-50-{\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-51-  \"name\": \"@community/cs-language-pack\",\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-52-  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-53-  \"mesh\": {\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-54-    \"apiVersion\": \"0.1\",\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-55-    \"kind\": \"language-pack\",\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-56-    \"provides\": {\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-57-      \"i18n\": [\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md:58:        { \"id\": \"launcher-cs\", \"locale\": \"cs\", \"module\": \"@mesh/launcher\",\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-59-          \"path\": \"translations/@mesh/launcher/cs.json\" },\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md:60:        { \"id\": \"panel-cs\", \"locale\": \"cs\", \"module\": \"@mesh/panel\",\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-61-          \"path\": \"translations/@mesh/panel/cs.json\" }\ndocs/spec/07-i18n.md-62-     