_set_locale` through normalized candidate preparation,\n  graph catalog preparation, revision-checked persistence, then live commit.\n  Active profiles receive a sparse `shell.i18n` override; no-profile operation\n  writes the shared `shell` namespace.\n- Updated other settings/profile mutation paths to advance revisions so they\n  cannot invalidate locale transactions silently.\n- Removed component-local `i18n.default_locale` active-locale mutation.\n- Added config, profile, and shell regression coverage; the shell test is\n  present but cannot compile until the known service error is fixed.\n\n## Verification\n\nPassed:\n\n- `nix develop --command cargo test -p mesh-core-config --lib` (42 tests)\n- `nix develop --command cargo test -p mesh-core-locale` (12 tests)\n- `nix develop --command cargo fmt --all -- --check`\n- `git diff --check`\n\nBlocked: module and shell tests/checks stop before those crates at the\npre-existing `InterfaceProvider` dereference error in\n`crates/core/extension/service/src/interface.rs:229`. Do not claim those\ntests passed.\n\n## Repository state\n\n- Repository: `/home/kolby/projects/mesh`.\n- All work is uncommitted; preserve the existing dirty tree and `codex-loop.log`.\n- Preserve the existing intended `Cargo.lock` changes.\n- Do not touch `.planning/archive/`.\n\n## Next work\n\nInspect the current host API, `mesh.i18n` library, service contract, LSP\nknowledge, and capability gates. Keep the change focused on ABI/capability\nagreement, add targeted regressions, run the runnable focused suites, record\nthe known service blocker, and update the backlog/log/status/handoff when the\nnext item is complete.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
