 and used when no catalog resolves; misses are\\nnon-fatal diagnostics with module id, field path, key, and fallback.\\n\\n**Props** — `label`/`description`/enum labels in `<props>` are\\n`LocalizedText` resolved the same way ([03 §3](03-components.md)). The\\ninstalled graph scans `.mesh` sources for `t()` keys and reports missing\\ncatalog entries.\\n\\n## 7. RTL, bidi, and script fallback\\n\\n- `locale.dir` exposes `\\\"ltr\\\"`/`\\\"rtl\\\"`; surfaces flip automatically for RTL\\n  locales. Authors use logical properties (`margin-inline-start`), not\\n  physical ones.\\n- Font fallback for scripts the active fonts lack is the renderer's job\\n  (cosmic-text); themes may declare script-specific stacks later\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_189\",\"type\":\"file_change\",\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"/home/kolby/projects/mesh/docs/BACKLOG.md\",\"kind\":\"update\"}],\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_189\",\"type\":\"file_change\",\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"/home/kolby/projects/mesh/docs/BACKLOG.md\",\"kind\":\"update\"}],\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_190\",\"type\":\"file_change\",\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"/home/kolby/projects/mesh/.planning/STATUS.md\",\"kind\":\"update\"}],\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_190\",\"type\":\"file_change\",\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"/home/kolby/projects/mesh/.planning/STATUS.md\",\"kind\":\"update\"}],\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_191\",\"type\":\"file_change\",\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"/home/kolby/projects/mesh/.planning/log/2026-08.md\",\"kind\":\"update\"}],\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_191\",\"type\":\"file_change\",\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"/home/kolby/projects/mesh/.planning/log/2026-08.md\",\"kind\":\"update\"}],\"status