icated under-approximations.\\\\\\\\n296:- [ ] Convert all LSP positions to UTF-16 code units at the protocol boundary.\\\\\\\\n297:- [ ] Make `--replace` and CLI flags enforce their documented typed behavior.\\\\\\\\n298:- [ ] Make LSP analysis syntax-aware with recoverable partial ASTs and useful mid-edit diagnostics.\\\\\\\\n299:- [ ] Replace heuristic Luau/JSON scanners with standards-compliant parsers and source-span data.\\\\\\\\n300:- [ ] Support workspace-folder-only initialization and versioned `didChange` refresh generations.\\\\\\\\n301:- [ ] Select manifest flavors from parsed structure, not textual substring checks.\\\\\\\\n302:- [ ] Make hover consume the current registry and expose service field/command documentation.\\\\\\\\n303:- [ ] Restrict definition resolution to existing module-contained imports.\\\\\\\\n304:- [ ] Preserve Unicode JSON escapes, registry generations, and secure import provenance in authoring diagnostics.\\\\\\\\n306:## Foundation contracts\\\\\\\\n308:## Module system\\\\\\\\n314:- [ ] Close module filesystem escapes before any package mutation or source\\\\\\\\n317:- [ ] Make installed-graph activation fail closed and build catalogs/provider\\\\\\\\n320:- [ ] Replace the duplicate CLI/shell package implementations with one locked,\\\\\\\\n323:- [ ] Enforce required/optional module dependencies, module/interface version\\\\\\\\n326:- [ ] Make the canonical `module.json` loader the only production path; legacy\\\\\\\\n329:- [ ] Make module lifecycle and health authoritative across graph, frontend, and\\\\\\\\n332:- [ ] Align the lock schema with the specification and populate dependency and\\\\\\\\n335:- [ ] Move the remaining built-in debug and theme/locale service behavior\\\\\\\\n339:- [ ] **Deferred — unify the four contribution schemas.** Theme, icons, i18n,\\\\\\\\n346:## Service contracts\\\\\\\\n348:- [ ] Replace the additive interface registry with one immutable, atomic\\\\\\\\n351:- [ ] Compile and enforce complete cont