on with one immutable,\\\\\\\\n402:- [ ] Make icon resolution deterministic and complete: canonical owner-scoped\\\\\\\\n405:- [ ] Complete font-pack runtime support with logical and pack-qualified roles,\\\\\\\\n408:- [ ] Unify XDG and font discovery into a refreshable host catalog; propagate\\\\\\\\n411:- [ ] Remove legacy icon config and discovery authorities, and drive bounded\\\\\\\\n415:## Component language\\\\\\\\n417:- [ ] Replace lossy `.mesh` block extraction and ad-hoc template preprocessing\\\\\\\\n420:- [ ] Make component compilation resolve imports per owner, enforce module-root\\\\\\\\n423:- [ ] Make the `<props>` contract one normalized typed value pipeline: reject\\\\\\\\n427:## UI element core\\\\\\\\n429:- [ ] Establish unique `NodeId` tree identity and reject duplicate/unknown\\\\\\\\n431:- [ ] Generate element contracts, runtime types, attributes, events, and\\\\\\\\n433:- [ ] Consolidate interaction, style invalidation, retained layout, and\\\\\\\\n436:- [ ] Normalize ARIA/visibility/name semantics after child construction and\\\\\\\\n439:## Interaction and motion\\\\\\\\n441:- [ ] Unify visibility, transformed geometry, disabled/inert eligibility, and\\\\\\\\n444:- [ ] Define a canonical interaction transaction for focus, pointer capture,\\\\\\\\n447:- [ ] Complete motion semantics: pause/resume, stable animation identity,\\\\\\\\n450:- [ ] Implement or safely gate the public `box-shadow` parser and add the\\\\\\\\n453:## Frontend compiler and host\\\\\\\\n455:- [ ] Compile, validate, watch, invalidate, and reload primary and\\\\\\\\n458:- [ ] Gate service payload publication on capabilities and replace the\\\\\\\\n461:- [ ] Complete frontend runtime lifecycle and recovery: dispatch mount/unmount,\\\\\\\\n464:- [ ] Unify template expression semantics and root-scope validation around the\\\\\\\\n467:- [ ] Split the renderer/Wayland/package/debug policy out of the\\\\\\\\n470:## Shell core and orchestration\\\\\\\\n472:- [ ] Replace split profi